<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine markets closed for Independence Day.</title>
<headline>Argentine markets closed for Independence Day.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine financial markets and businesses were closed Wednesday in observance of the Independence Day holiday.</p>
<p>They were scheduled to reopen Thursday.</p>
<p>((Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0618))</p>
</text>
